wcnt - Wav Composer Not Toilet

wcnt is a text based modular audio system intended for the creation of
WAV audio files. Consequentally wcnt does not respond to, or operate in,
real time. wcnt is not intended as a professional quality audio tool,
it is made by a hobbyist developer in their spare time.

While wcnt is text based, it is a modular audio system and not an audio
programming language like chuck or csound. But with over 80 modules
providing complex functionality such as sequencing, sampling, and
dynamic routing, DSP modules (via LADSPA), down to simple modules to
provide constant signals, wcnt is more than capable of providing unique
sounds.

wcnt is available at https://github.com/jwm-art-net/wcnt

wcnt is unsophisticated in its general handling of audio, it's limited
by a lack of good maths skill on my part. Waveforms are drawn, their
speed is modulated, they are triggered, it's more mechanically minded
than mathematically minded. I'm not mathematically minded. There's
no mathematical transforms or analysis.

However a handful of LADSPA plugins provide the features my maths skills
prevent me from tackling; filters, reverb, eq, pitch shifting, limiting
and compression.

Please see the INSTALL file for build instructions, and dependencies,
in particular you will want specific LADSPA plugin packages installed.

